# Repository root .gitignore
#
# This is a SHARED repo (origin: Janindu-Muthunayaka/R26-DS-002). Large research
# artefacts must not reach it: a single `git add -A` would push gigabytes to
# every teammate's clone, and git never forgets a blob once committed.
#
# The corpus, model weights and pipeline outputs live OUTSIDE this repo.
# See system/core/config.py (SINHALA_ROOT) for where the code expects them.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: *.png / *.jpg in general, so result figures and
# README images can still be committed. Only bulk locations are excluded.

# --- corpus / dataset trees, if one is ever copied in by accident ----------
corpus/
Sinhala_OCR_Correction_v2/
**/raw_pages/
**/raw_halfpages/
**/deskewed/
**/newspapers/
**/pipeline_out/

# --- model weights ---------------------------------------------------------
models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.tflite

# --- archives and caches ---------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.npz

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# --- local run output ------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: do not write a bare `work/` rule here. Git on Windows matches ignore
# patterns case-insensitively, so `work/` also matches the tracked `Work/`
# folder and hides every team member's directory. Scope it explicitly.
/system/work/
/system/tools/out/
*.log

# --- the device bridge cannot delete files; things staged for removal go here
_to_delete/
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/venv311
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/Result
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/InputImages
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/AllImages
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/Result-NonFiltered
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/Result-FilteredAllThreeMethods
/Work/Janindu/0_Data/FontFiles
/Work/Janindu/0_Data/FontImages
/Work/Janindu/0_Data/SkeletonImages
/Work/Janindu/0_Data/Model/venv
/Work/Janindu/2_Recogniton/Information
/Work/Janindu/2_Recogniton/InputFolder
/Work/Janindu/2_Recogniton/OutputFolder
/Work/Janindu/2_Recogniton/venv311
Work/Janindu/0_Data/Model/best_model.pth
Work/Janindu/0_Data/Model/checkpoint.pth
/Work/Janindu/3_FrontEnd/Outputs
/Work/Janindu/3_FrontEnd/Processes
/Work/Janindu/3_FrontEnd/Inputs
/Work/Janindu/0_Data
/Work/Janindu/1_Preprocess/venvpaddle/Lib
